What this covers
----------------

Everything under `courses/`, in every language, including:

  - lesson text and course outlines
  - quiz questions and answer keys
  - the checklists, glossaries and reference tables in the appendices
  - the typeset PDF editions under `courses/*/pdf-book/`, both the
    LaTeX sources and the compiled PDFs

It covers the course material as prose and teaching content. It does not
cover the application that renders it.


What you may do
---------------

Share it, print it, translate it, cut it down, build on it, and publish
the result under your own name — including commercially, and without
asking us first.

This is deliberate. Chambers of commerce, trade associations, schools,
public bodies and consultancies are welcome to turn this material into
their own guidance under their own branding. We would rather see a
chamber publish its own leaflet than link to ours.


The one condition
-----------------

Give appropriate credit: name the source, link to the licence, and
indicate if you made changes. A line such as the following is enough:

    Based on the NIS 2 management training by NISD2.eu
    (https://nisd2.eu), CC BY 4.0, adapted.

You may not imply that we endorse you or your adaptation.


What this licence does NOT change
---------------------------------

  - The application code, scripts and workspace-only packages remain
    AGPL-3.0-or-later. See ../LICENSE.
  - `@nisd2/grc-data-model` remains MIT. See
    ../packages/grc-data-model/LICENSE.
  - The other published packages keep their own licences. See the
    licence table in ../README.md.


Not legal advice, and not a certification
-----------------------------------------

This material teaches the NIS 2 Directive and the concepts behind it. It
is not legal advice. No body in the EU currently certifies NIS 2 training
or NIS 2 trainers, and this licence is not an accreditation of any kind.
Reusing this material does not make you or your organisation compliant,
and it does not transfer any obligation of ours to you or any of yours
to us.
